{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2021-11-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'CVS HEALTH COMPLETES ROLLOUT OF TIME DELAY SAFES IN ALL 851 TEXAS PHARMACIES', 'text': 'WOONSOCKET, R.I., NOV. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AS\xa0PART OF AN ONGOING COMMITMENT TO HELPING BUILD HEALTHIER AND SAFER COMMUNITIES, CVS HEALTH (NYSE: CVS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETED INSTALLATION OF TIME DELAY SAFE TECHNOLOGY IN ALL 851 CVS PHARMACY LOCATIONS, INCLUDING THOSE IN TARGET STORES, ACROSS TEXAS.'}